meta {
  name: dev
  seq: 14
}

docs {
  The developer explorer (ADR-018). Every route needs a Care login and `ABDM_DEVELOPER_MODE=true`;
  otherwise HTTP 403 names the setting. `1. status` answers every authenticated user. Every body is
  redacted by name and length: tokens, OTPs, passwords, keys and photos show as `<redacted, N chars>`,
  header values never. Read-only.
}
